{
  "name": "InvoiceIQ - 1 Intake",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## InvoiceIQ intake\nTwo ways in: an email with PDF attachments (Gmail, polled every minute) or the upload form. Each PDF starts its own run of **2 Process invoice**, so each one gets its own OpsCore callback. Processed emails get the Gmail label **invoices** and are not picked up again.\n\nDemo mailbox filter: `from:me subject:invoice` (the test invoices are emailed to the owner's own inbox). With a dedicated AP mailbox, drop `from:me`.",
        "height": 210,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 7
      },
      "id": "23cd0f41-9da2-4af8-a012-d77f1de6dba1",
      "name": "Note 1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -330
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "pollTimes": {
          "item": [
            {
              "mode": "everyMinute"
            }
          ]
        },
        "simple": false,
        "filters": {
          "q": "from:me subject:invoice has:attachment filename:pdf -label:invoices",
          "readStatus": "both"
        },
        "options": {
          "downloadAttachments": true,
          "dataPropertyAttachmentsPrefixName": "attachment_"
        }
      },
      "id": "d03dc741-1804-4f80-8b2e-5afa57eab5bf",
      "name": "New invoice email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmailTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "credentials": {
        "gmailOAuth2": {
          "id": "YDXfApN2odjnWTHz",
          "name": "Gmail - InvoiceIQ"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// One item per PDF attachment, with the email's metadata. Non-PDF attachments are ignored.\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const m = item.json;\n  const from = m.from?.value?.[0]?.address || m.from?.text || '';\n  for (const [key, bin] of Object.entries(item.binary || {})) {\n    const name = bin.fileName || key;\n    if (bin.mimeType !== 'application/pdf' && !/\\.pdf$/i.test(name)) continue;\n    out.push({\n      json: {\n        source: 'email', source_ref: m.id, source_email: from, subject: m.subject || '', file_name: name,\n        received_at: m.date ? new Date(m.date).toISOString() : new Date().toISOString(),\n      },\n      binary: { file: bin },\n    });\n  }\n}\nreturn out;\n"
      },
      "id": "3270ae20-473f-49d5-81cc-702f65f95c18",
      "name": "One item per PDF (email)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "source": "database",
        "workflowId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "D9nN9vOhnGkx79En",
          "mode": "id",
          "cachedResultName": "InvoiceIQ - 2 Process invoice"
        },
